    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13318" root="دهن" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدْهِنٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 4, q. v.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفَبِهٰذَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَدِيثِ أَنْتُمْ مُدْهِنُونَ</span>, in the Kur [lvi. 80],
means <i>Do ye then reject this announcement?</i> or
<i>disbelieve</i> &amp;c.? (TA:) or <i>hold in light,</i> or <i>little,</i>
or <i>mean, estimation,</i> (Bd, Jel,) <i>and reject,</i> &amp;c.?
(Jel.)

